==Battleground==
*15 [[Doge]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*15 [[Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
*4 [[Funghi (Enemy)|Funghi]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

